# 自分自身を指す開いた仮身を編集中の記録で描く (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A text with an
# opened link to itself (xml, xmlbig: ffffffff-... stands for the object itself) is opened in
# the desktop's own text editor (docproc kernel, open) and in the process (pdoc), and letters
# are typed into its first paragraph without saving. The desktop draws its own object inside
# the link as it is being edited (the record of its window is the store's); the process,
# given its record as the one being edited (tv_src_live), must draw the same: the shots after
# the letters (self_k_typed, self_p_typed) are compared inside the window (101,125 to 682,482
# of the screen), as are those on opening. Neither is saved before the shots: Ctrl+E, which
# saves, closes each after them.
# Keys: x 1b; Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
look 306 3600000
mkbig doc 1
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document>
xml <p>自分への開いた仮身の前の段落</p>
xml <p>自分への開いた仮身
xml <link id="ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff_0.xtad" heightpx="200" width="520" chsz="14" tbcol="#e1f2f9" bgcol="#ffffff"/>
xml </p>
xml <p>後の段落</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 800
move 690 490
sync 600
wait 300
shot self_k_open
click 300 135
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
key 1b
sync 600
key 1b
sync 600
key 1b
sync 600
wait 500
shot self_k_typed
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig doc 1
xml <tad version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"><document>
xml <p>自分への開いた仮身の前の段落</p>
xml <p>自分への開いた仮身
xml <link id="ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff_0.xtad" heightpx="200" width="520" chsz="14" tbcol="#e1f2f9" bgcol="#ffffff"/>
xml </p>
xml <p>後の段落</p>
xml </document></tad>
xmlbig
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 3
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 500
shot self_p_open
logmark
click 300 135
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
key 1b
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 300
logmark
key 1b
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 300
logmark
key 1b
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 800
shot self_p_typed
shotsame self_k_open self_p_open 101 125 682 482
shotsame self_k_typed self_p_typed 101 125 682 482
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
